---
import Code from './Code.astro';
import {deployButtonUrl} from '../lib/config.mjs';
import {installShell,installNpm} from '../lib/links.mjs';
const {id='deploy',cli=true}=Astro.props;
const oneClick=deployButtonUrl();
const init=`${installShell}
# or: ${installNpm}
slurp cloud init`;
const manual=`cd backend
npm install
npx wrangler login
npx wrangler r2 bucket create slurp-archive
npx wrangler deploy
openssl rand -base64 32 > admin-token.txt
npx wrangler secret put ADMIN_TOKEN < admin-token.txt
slurp connect https://slurp.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev \\
  --token-stdin < admin-token.txt`;
const connect=`slurp connect https://slurp.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev \\
  --token-stdin < admin-token.txt
slurp setup
slurp init --name "My app"`;
---
<span class="deploy-actions">
{oneClick&&<a class="deploy-official" href={oneClick} rel="noopener" data-track="deploy_clicked" data-track-where={id}><img src="https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/button" alt="Deploy to Cloudflare" width="184" height="39"/></a>}
{cli&&<button type="button" class="deploy-cli" data-deploy-open={id}>{oneClick?'Install with the CLI instead':'Install and deploy'} ↗</button>}
</span>
<dialog class="deploy" id={`dialog-${id}`} aria-labelledby={`title-${id}`}>
<form method="dialog" class="close"><button aria-label="Close">×</button></form>
<p class="eyebrow">Self-host</p>
<h2 id={`title-${id}`}>Run Slurp in your own Cloudflare account.</h2>
<p class="fine">Your Worker, Durable Objects and R2 bucket live in your account. Slurp does not host your events. The Free plan is enough to start.</p>
<p>One command installs the CLI, logs in to Cloudflare, creates the R2 bucket, deploys the Worker, sets a generated admin token and connects this computer. You need Node 20+ (slurp fetches wrangler itself) and a Cloudflare account, on macOS or Linux.</p>
<Code label="Install, deploy and connect" code={init} track="install_copied"/>
<p class="fine">Then run <code>slurp setup</code> and <code>slurp init --name "My app"</code>. Later: <code>slurp cloud status</code>, <code>slurp cloud upgrade</code>, <code>slurp cloud destroy</code>.</p>
{oneClick&&<details><summary>Prefer the one-click button?</summary><p>The Deploy to Cloudflare button copies this project's <code>backend</code> folder into a new repository in your GitHub account and creates the R2 bucket and Durable Objects for you. When it asks for <code>ADMIN_TOKEN</code>, paste a long random value, for example from <code>openssl rand -base64 32</code>, and keep it: it controls your deployment. Then open your Worker's address (it looks like <code>https://slurp.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev</code>); the page there shows the command that connects the CLI:</p><Code label="Terminal" code={connect}/><a class="deploy-official" href={oneClick} rel="noopener" data-track="deploy_clicked" data-track-where={id}><img src="https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/button" alt="Deploy to Cloudflare" width="184" height="39" loading="lazy"/></a></details>}
<details><summary>Prefer to run wrangler yourself?</summary><Code label="Manual steps" code={manual}/><p class="fine">Replace <code>YOUR-SUBDOMAIN</code> with the URL <code>wrangler deploy</code> prints. Delete <code>admin-token.txt</code> once it is saved in your password manager.</p></details>
</dialog>
<script>
const open=(id:string)=>{const d=document.getElementById('dialog-'+id);if(d instanceof HTMLDialogElement&&!d.open)d.showModal()};
for(const b of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-deploy-open]'))b.addEventListener('click',()=>open(b.dataset.deployOpen!));
for(const d of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLDialogElement>('dialog.deploy'))d.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===d)d.close()});
if(location.hash==='#deploy')open('deploy');
</script>
<style>
.deploy-actions{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px 18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.deploy-official{display:inline-block;line-height:0;border-radius:6px}
.deploy-official img{display:block;width:184px;height:39px}
.deploy-cli{border:0;background:none;padding:6px 2px;font:550 13px var(--body);color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;cursor:pointer}
.deploy-cli:hover{color:var(--ink)}
dialog.deploy{max-width:680px;width:calc(100% - 32px);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;padding:28px clamp(18px,4vw,36px);color:var(--ink);background:var(--surface);box-shadow:0 24px 80px #17191c33}
dialog.deploy::backdrop{background:#17191c66}
dialog.deploy h2{margin-top:0}
dialog.deploy .close{position:absolute;top:10px;right:12px;margin:0}
dialog.deploy .close button{border:0;background:none;font-size:26px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);padding:4px 10px}
details{margin:12px 0}summary{cursor:pointer;font:600 13px var(--body)}
</style>
